    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Survive till 100 years old&quot;</i> - A Unique Survival Game Blending Match-3 Gameplay and Strategic Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey of humor and crisis as you experience the struggle to &quot;live to 100 years old&quot; in this exciting game that combines classic match-3 mechanics with survival strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must utilize classic match-3 gameplay to gather essential resources to maintain nutrition, stay healthy, and acquire skills. These resources will aid you in overcoming various challenges as you progress through life, ensuring you can &quot;survive&quot; for as long as possible in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430570/extras/b9f6e4ef7e9e3af0054543c6d2e1672b.avif?t=1740885058\" width=590 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Events and Increasing Difficulty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your character ages, the game\u2019s difficulty gradually escalates. From initial illnesses and accidents to mounting pressures and temptations, you\u2019ll face an array of obstacles that test your strategy and decision-making skills. These challenges may disrupt your plans, requiring meticulous planning at every step, as one wrong move could lead to a complete failure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430570/extras/df098d0232237413b4df00cbe6c6df10.avif?t=1740885058\" width=590 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Duel of Strategy and Luck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game demands sharp planning abilities while introducing an element of unpredictable luck. Successfully surviving to the age of 100 is not only a testament to your wisdom but also a stroke of good fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430570/extras/3e5df030406def56fc9dd59af24bc825.avif?t=1740885058\" width=590 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Perfect Blend of Match-3 and Survival Simulation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Event System</strong>: Enhances replayability and adds challenging unpredictability, with a variety of achievements waiting for you to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aging Mechanism</strong>: Realistically mirrors life\u2019s challenges as you grow older.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life Elements Collection</strong>: Gather 17 unique elements, 40+ events, to complete your growth chart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Graphics and a Relaxed Gameplay Style</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer Tips:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Be sure to check the encyclopedia regularly to understand the role and impact of each element on life activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In the early stages of life, <strong>ensuring proper nutrition is the most important</strong>, and when element variety is limited, <strong>try to complete 4-matches or 5-matches whenever possible</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Some important growth events <strong>only occur when you make a wish on your birthday</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Not all growth events <strong>have a positive impact</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you ready for the ultimate test of wit, strategy, and luck? In <i>&quot;Survive till 100 years old&quot;</i>, every game is a brand-new adventure!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Survive till 100 years old&quot;</i> - A Unique Survival Game Blending Match-3 Gameplay and Strategic Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey of humor and crisis as you experience the struggle to &quot;live to 100 years old&quot; in this exciting game that combines classic match-3 mechanics with survival strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must utilize classic match-3 gameplay to gather essential resources to maintain nutrition, stay healthy, and acquire skills. These resources will aid you in overcoming various challenges as you progress through life, ensuring you can &quot;survive&quot; for as long as possible in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430570/extras/b9f6e4ef7e9e3af0054543c6d2e1672b.avif?t=1740885058\" width=590 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Events and Increasing Difficulty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your character ages, the game\u2019s difficulty gradually escalates. From initial illnesses and accidents to mounting pressures and temptations, you\u2019ll face an array of obstacles that test your strategy and decision-making skills. These challenges may disrupt your plans, requiring meticulous planning at every step, as one wrong move could lead to a complete failure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430570/extras/df098d0232237413b4df00cbe6c6df10.avif?t=1740885058\" width=590 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Duel of Strategy and Luck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game demands sharp planning abilities while introducing an element of unpredictable luck. Successfully surviving to the age of 100 is not only a testament to your wisdom but also a stroke of good fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430570/extras/3e5df030406def56fc9dd59af24bc825.avif?t=1740885058\" width=590 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Perfect Blend of Match-3 and Survival Simulation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Event System</strong>: Enhances replayability and adds challenging unpredictability, with a variety of achievements waiting for you to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aging Mechanism</strong>: Realistically mirrors life\u2019s challenges as you grow older.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life Elements Collection</strong>: Gather 17 unique elements, 40+ events, to complete your growth chart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Graphics and a Relaxed Gameplay Style</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer Tips:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Be sure to check the encyclopedia regularly to understand the role and impact of each element on life activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In the early stages of life, <strong>ensuring proper nutrition is the most important</strong>, and when element variety is limited, <strong>try to complete 4-matches or 5-matches whenever possible</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Some important growth events <strong>only occur when you make a wish on your birthday</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Not all growth events <strong>have a positive impact</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you ready for the ultimate test of wit, strategy, and luck? In <i>&quot;Survive till 100 years old&quot;</i>, every game is a brand-new adventure!</h2>",
    "short_description": "How hard is it to &quot;survive&quot; to 100? This match-3 strategy game brings the answer with fun and challenges! In the game, players must use match-3 mechanics to gain nutrition, maintain health, and acquire skills to survive. Wisdom and strategy might help you achieve the goal, but luck is indispensable!",
